"""Patina 0.40.0: grime along every ground storey's base.

`framing.base_grime_orders`: a `stain_base` along each span of a ground storey's side, between its corners and the
openings or glass that come down into the band; `openings.EXEMPT` gains `stain_base`.

Proven: tests/test_base_grime.py and tests/test_openings.py fail on 0.39.0 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone's suite,
430 passed (suite_clone.out.txt); the slice rebuilt and priced (the factory's docs/findings/slice_look/, slices
18-20: draws median +0, largest +2).
"""
